<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I am very sorry to hear about the circumstances of your trip with us on {!Case.TECH_Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}. Please accept my sincere condolences.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If fare requesting refund use:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We know there are times when our customers need to travel at short notice due to personal situations, so we offer discounted ‘Community Fares’ on our domestic network. These give our Contact Centre staff the flexibility to offer customers a reduction on our more expensive fares, which are often the only seats left when booking travel at the last minute.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><font size="2">-<i>If staff said to book online add:-</i></font></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Many discounted tickets available on qantas.com are cheaper than these special fares, and if they are still available, our Contact Centre staff will usually direct customers to book directly on our website.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If refunding fare difference add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I’ve spoken to our ticketing department and have arranged a refund of ${!Case.Recovery_Value__c}, which is the difference between the fare you paid and the Community Fare on this ticket. This will reflect in the original form of payment in approximately 7 business days.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If refunding change fees add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I have checked your booking and can see that the amount&nbsp;you were charged was correct. Due to your compassionate situation, I have arranged a refund of the <b>-<i>service/change</i></b>-&nbsp;fee as a gesture of goodwill.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If not refunding fare difference add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Red e-Deals, Classic Award and International fares are not eligible for a Community Fare discount, so I regret we are unable to meet your request for a refund. I can provide a letter for your insurance company, if you think you may be able to make a claim due to the unexpected circumstances. Please let me know if you require a letter.&nbsp;</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><font size="2"><i>-If not refunding change fees add:</i>-</font></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">When our fares come with special conditions or restrictions, we make sure our customers understand what they are before they complete their booking. I have checked your booking notes and they show that <b>-<i>you agreed to the conditions when booking on our website/these the conditions of your fare were explained to you upon purchase</i>-</b>, so I am unable to meet your request for a refund for the amount you were charged to change your ticket. I can provide a letter for your insurance company, if you think you may be able to make a claim due to the unexpected circumstances. Please let me know if you require a letter.&nbsp;</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I appreciate you taking the time to contact us and hope that we have the opportunity to welcome you on board in the future under happier circumstances.&nbsp;</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia&nbsp;</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>